  "ingredients": [
    "6 ounce boneless, skinless chicken thighs",
    "1 tablespoon soy sauce",
    "1 tablespoon powdered erythritol",
    "1/4 teaspoon ground ginger",
    "1/4 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1 tablespoon avocado oil",
    "1/2 medium zucchini (diced)",
    "1/4 medium yellow onion (diced)",
    "2 tablespoon butter",
    "salt (to taste)",
    "1/2 teaspoon sesame seeds",
    "2 ounce broccoli (steamed)",
    "1 medium green onion (thinly sliced)",
    "3 ounce cauliflower rice",
    "1 tablespoon avocado oil"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-teriyaki-bowl/#wprm-recipe-53893-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Chicken-Teriyaki-Bowl-1-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut the chicken thighs into small bite sized pieces.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-teriyaki-bowl/#wprm-recipe-53893-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Chicken-Teriyaki-Bowl-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine the sauce ingredients for the chicken: soy sauce, powdered erythritol, ground ginger, garlic powder, and avocado oil into a bowl. Stir to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-teriyaki-bowl/#wprm-recipe-53893-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Chicken-Teriyaki-Bowl-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add the diced chicken pieces to the pan and cook until internal temperature reaches 165F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-teriyaki-bowl/#wprm-recipe-53893-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Chicken-Teriyaki-Bowl-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the sauce on the cooked chicken pieces. Remove from pan and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-teriyaki-bowl/#wprm-recipe-53893-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Chicken-Teriyaki-Bowl-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook the vegetables by adding the butter, zucchini, yellow onion, sesame seeds, broccoli, and green onion. Sautee this for 3 - 5 minutes. Season with salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-teriyaki-bowl/#wprm-recipe-53893-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Chicken-Teriyaki-Bowl-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook the cauliflower rice and avocado oil together on medium heat for 4 - 6 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-teriyaki-bowl/#wprm-recipe-53893-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Chicken-Teriyaki-Bowl-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the teriyaki bowls by combining the cauliflower rice, vegetables, and chicken into a bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-teriyaki-bowl/#wprm-recipe-53893-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Chicken-Teriyaki-Bowl-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-teriyaki-bowl/#wprm-recipe-53893-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
